<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>基础设施 - 分类 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/categories/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD/</link><description>基础设施 - 分类 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</managingEditor><webMaster>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</webMaster><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 08 Apr 2022 21:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://spaceack.github.io/categories/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Docker问题处理</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20220405-docker%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Apr 2022 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20220405-docker%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h3 id="x509-certificate-signed-by-unknown-authority">x509: certificate signed by unknown authority</h3>
<p><code>docker pull</code> 或 <code>docker login 192.1.11.18</code> 报错</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">Error response from daemon: Get &#34;https://192.1.11.18/v2/&#34;: x509: certificate signed by unknown authority</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>解决方法：</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>在<code>/etc/docker/daemon.json/daemon.json</code> 添加 <code>{insecure-registries&quot;:[&quot;192.1.11.18&quot;]}</code>, <code>sudo systemctl restart docker</code></p>]]></description></item><item><title>使用docker-compose安装mariadb</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20200910-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8docker-compose%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85mariadb/</link><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2020 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20200910-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8docker-compose%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85mariadb/</guid><description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>
<p>step1: 创建目录</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">mkdir -p /server/mariadb/<span class="o">{</span>config,data,log<span class="o">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">chmod -R <span class="m">777</span> /server/mariadb</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
<li>
<p>step2: 编写docker-compose.yml</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-yaml">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
